      "value": "update: here's all I tried so far.\n\nRestarting clients\n\nResetting settings\n\nClearing caches\n\nReinstalling clients\n\ntoggling settings that helped before\n\nFixed: \n\nbootup option working again\n\nStill broken:\n\nAvatar FBT calibration and tracking issues\n\nIssue notes from friend who tried to help: \n\nTrackers are not lining up with avatar but are lining up in steam and physical space. \n\nTracking options like locomotion toggles are not working in vrc\n\nTrack calibration visuals are not visible\n\nSpine lock has no difference\n\nLoading into vrc is automatically starting calibration for FBT",
