  "details": "I have tried to fix it and even set Spine Mode to Lock Head which was what fixed it originally. But VRChat had problems and couldn't load new avatars from myself or others. I rebooted VRC and it was broken when I logged back in. I don't know how to explain the issue but all I have is screenshots of the problem. I think the Spine Mode is broken now and I can't fix it at all. It's also now not asking when starting up game if I want to do desktop or VR (the setting it's on when I try to boot, it's ignoring it). A serious amount of issues that happened.",
